---
import Layout from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Access and pricing: High Signal Podcasts"
  description="Current access and pricing state for the High Signal Podcasts website and public read-only API."
>
  <section class="info-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Current access state</p>
    <h1>Browse the public index without an account or charge.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The website and public read-only API currently require no account, API key, subscription,
      or checkout. This describes the product today and does not promise a permanent pricing model.
    </p>
    <div class="info-grid">
      <article><p class="folio">Website / 01</p><h2>Public browsing.</h2><p>Search claims and browse people, sources, and recommendations without signing up.</p></article>
      <article><p class="folio">API / 02</p><h2>Read-only access.</h2><p>Published evidence is available through the documented GET endpoints without an API key.</p></article>
      <article><p class="folio">Boundary / 03</p><h2>No permanent promise.</h2><p>The repository establishes no future plan, paid tier, or permanent free tier, so none is claimed here.</p></article>
    </div>
    <div class="info-actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/search">Search published claims</a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/developers">Read the API guide</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
